{"id":"c3f20b7f-206b-47cc-8859-8b3abd00cc28","object":"chat.completion","created":1788260841,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"I have everything needed: the module catalog, grammar, and canonical handler idiom (`export function handler(req: Request): Proof<Response, ...>`, with `req.method`/`req.path` from the durable example). Drafting the minimal deterministic handler with a route guard.","reasoning_content":"I have the full meta. Key facts:

