Hmm. The spec: "Create a handler in handler.ts that responds to GET /health with Response.json({ ok: true }). Keep it minimal and deterministic."

I'll include the method/path guard — that's what "responds to GET /health" means and it's still minimal (3 lines of logic). Actually, to be safe about determinism claims, I can declare just "deterministic" | "state_isolated" — both hold.

